								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg8369#msg8369"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg8369#msg8369">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1145 on:</b> June 08, 2004, 01:55:43 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Fairly accurate list, <i>some differences between where each guild can be fitted in each tier might be debatable</i>...<br /><br />- Top Tier (beyond PoTime) -<br />1} Ascent<br />2} DA/EiE<br /><br />- Second Tier (PoTime) -<br />3} FoT<br />4} Conviction<br /><br />- Third Tier (Elemental) - <br />5} Hegemony<br />6} Reign of Swords<br />7} SoD alliance (Euro time elemental guild)<br />8} Union of Power<br /><br />- Fourth Tier (Pre-elemental)<br />9} Ruination (Forsaken remnants and recruits)<br />10} Apotheosis<br />11} Dragon&#039;s Fist<br />12} Brewmasters<br />13} Outcast Adventurers<br />14} Tul Acharn/Junn Horde<br />15} Exiled Knights<br />16} G.C./Adv.Co./Ecce Neco<br /><br />That pretty much covers any guilds making any progression through PoP/Luclin(VT/SSRA) raid encounters I think...<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
