								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&nbsp;I agree with Dalla.<br /> <br />Really Apoth downward is where the list might be changing. All those guilds are basically 1 or 2 kills differnt from one another. And on any given /day or night they can pull off a kill that will place them ahead of another guild.<br /><br /> Besides them the only guild that i can see moving anywhere up the list is Ruination. However i know that they wiped last might to RZtW twice but were trying again for the 3rd time, dont know how that went for them though.
